const breadcrumbs=[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'About Salmon',path:'/about/'}];
---
<Layout title="About Salmon Joy | AI Engineer & Enterprise Trainer" description="Meet Salmon Joy: Mumbai-based AI engineer, enterprise trainer and OpenAI Programme Master Trainer. 8+ years of experience and 10,000+ learners trained." pageType="ProfilePage" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
<section class="editorial-hero dark-scene"><Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs}/><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE PROMPTS</span><h1>Salmon Joy.<br/><em>A builder. A teacher.</em></h1><p>I’m an AI engineer and educator based in Mumbai. I help teams turn AI curiosity into practical skills and working solutions.</p></section>
<section class="editorial-wrap"><div class="profile-layout"><img class="profile-photo" src="/images/portrait.webp" width="800" height="800" alt="Salmon Joy, AI engineer and enterprise trainer, wearing a burgundy blazer."/><article class="reading-copy"><h2>Practical AI, grounded in experience.</h2><p>My work connects enterprise AI engineering with hands-on training for professionals, developers and educators. Across 8+ years of experience, I have trained 10,000+ learners and built a portfolio of 21 projects across AI and engineering.</p><p>{programme}</p><p>I deliver on-site workshops across India and live online training for Indian and international teams. The starting point is the audience’s work: what they need to understand, practise and evaluate.</p><a href="/training/" class="text-link">Explore the training paths <Icon/></a></article></div><div class="editorial-split"><article class="reading-copy"><h2>What I build informs how I teach.</h2><p>My portfolio includes enterprise retrieval-augmented generation, banking document automation, training-data pipelines, model evaluation and practical applications. These projects provide examples of the decisions that sit between a useful prototype and a system a team can inspect.</p><p>I make room for limitations in the explanation. A generated answer needs review; a benchmark needs its context; a confident demo needs testing. The goal is to help people understand what they can use and what they still need to check.</p><a href="/projects/" class="text-link">Explore 21 projects <Icon/></a><h2>A continuing journey.</h2><ul class="journey-list"><li><strong>Engineering education, 2014–2018.</strong> Mechanical Engineering at Fr. Conceicao Rodrigues Institute of Technology.</li><li><strong>Early training and engineering.</strong> AI training at AutoDice, engineering at SmartByte Computer Education, and independent training.</li><li><strong>Consulting, 2022–2024.</strong> AI and ML Consultant at Accennovate Tech Solutions.</li><li><strong>Academic learning, 2024–2025.</strong> Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning Expert at GITAM.</li><li><strong>Current engineering work.</strong> AI Engineer at GRAVITY — Hyper-Personalization Banking Platform.</li><li><strong>OpenAI programme.</strong> {programme}</li></ul></article><aside class="evidence-panel"><h2>Knowledge, shared.</h2><p>I publish AI for the Lazy Genius and educational videos that make technical ideas approachable.</p><a class="text-link" href="/insights/">Read the practical AI guides <Icon/></a><a class="text-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@ai.4.lazygenius" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the educational videos <Icon/></a><h3>Giving back</h3><p>Technical Trainer with Yogdaanam Foundation since 2019, supporting social service and digital education.</p><h3>Continuing to learn</h3><ul><li><a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/f92e7aac-3208-4609-8a77-29874ae0239c/public_url">AWS Academy Graduate — Cloud Architecting</a></li><li><a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/cd51aa97-f351-429d-85f5-700c92b80cea/public_url">AWS Academy Graduate — Cloud Foundations</a></li><li><a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/records/85EN8MXYGUSV">Google Cloud Big Data & ML Fundamentals</a></li></ul><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/salmonjoy/">View LinkedIn profile <Icon/></a></aside></div><section class="profile-evidence"><h2>Real rooms. Real learning.</h2><figure><img src="/images/workshop-acpatil.webp" width="1080" height="810" loading="lazy" alt="Salmon Joy with participants at an AI and machine learning workshop at A C Patil College."/><figcaption><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7164637706701029376/">Workshop at A C Patil College of Engineering — view the original post ↗</a></figcaption></figure><p>Selected training engagements include Techanzy, Tata International and Ajanta Pharma. <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7521572079490707458/">See a recent enterprise training engagement.</a></p><a href="/Salmon%20Joy%20Profile%202025%20(2).pdf" class="text-link">Download the historical 2025 trainer profile ↓</a><p class="editorial-note">The downloadable profile is an archival document; some details reflect its publication period.</p></section></section>
</Layout>
